WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.104
Listening includes sustained attention, suitable posture, relevant facial expression,

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:08.008
brief notes and accurate recall of what was heard.

00:00:08.867 --> 00:00:14.085
“An old tree shaded the school playground.” Which detail shows a benefit? Answer: It

00:00:14.085 --> 00:00:15.203
shaded the playground.

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:20.861
Listen to a classmate's announcement without interruption; report its topic and two

00:00:20.861 --> 00:00:21.665
key details.

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:25.136
Why it works: Shade is a benefit for learners.
